{"3872230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Game of Dice", "steam_appid": 3872230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/7846784ca756300c0a39000f42883f1e.avif?t=1764821179\" width=1024 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the cities, dominate the board!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real-time board battle against players from all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice, seize cities, and survive to bankrupt your opponents in thrilling matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of skill cards and charming characters, dive into an endless battle of strategy and wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▣ Real-Time PvP Matches With Duelists Around the World!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duelists around the world, gather round!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends around the world through seasonal rankings and tournaments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/36aac1d2e30f323ea4870fb049fc720f.poster.avif?t=1764821179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/36aac1d2e30f323ea4870fb049fc720f.webm?t=1764821179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/36aac1d2e30f323ea4870fb049fc720f.mp4?t=1764821179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▣ Colorful Animation Dice!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot Dice, Panda Dice, Devil Dice... Choose what you want and craft it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the great animations of over a hundred Dice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/02e267f750375e21b0a5a03ad78639fc.poster.avif?t=1764821179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/02e267f750375e21b0a5a03ad78639fc.webm?t=1764821179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/02e267f750375e21b0a5a03ad78639fc.mp4?t=1764821179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▣ Customize Your Deck With Skills!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from over 200 Skills to create your own strategy for victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various Skills like ‘Push’, ‘Drag’, and ‘Summon’!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/005017727337ec84bed358596e93c860.poster.avif?t=1764821179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872230/extras/005017727337ec84bed358596e93c860.webm?t=1764821179\" type=\"video